WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:05.575
"Izzie!" Nina said.

2
00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:08.381
"Can you sleep over on Saturday?"

3
00:00:08.382 --> 00:00:12.385
Izzie smiled. "I'll ask my mom.

4
00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:14.454
I think so!"

5
00:00:14.455 --> 00:00:16.925
Nina bounced on her toes.

6
00:00:16.926 --> 00:00:19.730
"We'll have so much fun!"

7
00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:22.987
She looked at Bobby and Jason.

8
00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:29.207
"Sorry, boys. The sleepover is just for girls."

9
00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.509
Bobby rolled his eyes.

10
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:36.475
"We don't want to go to a girls' sleepover."

11
00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:42.137
"Everyone—boys and girls—will like today's recipe," Chef said.

12
00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:45.143
"It's vanilla ice cream."

13
00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:47.542
Jason looked disappointed.

14
00:00:47.543 --> 00:00:51.551
"I don't really like ice cream." He shrugged.

15
00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:53.949
"I'll try it though."

16
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.984
"The recipe is simple," Chef said.

17
00:00:56.985 --> 00:00:59.436
"But it takes a while to freeze.

18
00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:02.832
Let's get started."

19
00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:07.200
Nina poured a can of condensed milk into a bowl.

20
00:01:07.201 --> 00:01:11.574
Izzie added salt and vanilla.

21
00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:14.650
Bobby whisked everything together.

22
00:01:14.651 --> 00:01:22.545
"Now we have to whip two cups of heavy cream," Jason said. Izzie

23
00:01:22.546 --> 00:01:26.653
whipped the cream with the mixer. "I

24
00:01:26.654 --> 00:01:32.489
see peaks!" Bobby shouted. "It's ready!" Chef

25
00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:38.767
nodded. "Nina, please fold a cup of whipped cream into the milk mixture. Next,

26
00:01:38.768 --> 00:01:44.861
we'll fold that mixture into the rest of the whipped cream." The

27
00:01:44.862 --> 00:01:54.652
kids followed the instructions. Then

28
00:01:54.653 --> 00:01:58.424
Chef removed a pan from the freezer. "I

29
00:01:58.425 --> 00:02:00.731
chilled this loaf pan. We'll

30
00:02:00.732 --> 00:02:04.110
freeze our mixture in it for two hours. Before

31
00:02:04.111 --> 00:02:10.676
you go home, we'll stir in our final ingredient." ***

32
00:02:10.677 --> 00:02:17.799
While the mixture was freezing, the kids went outside to do chores.

33
00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.984
"You boys can pick vegetables," Nina said.

34
00:02:21.985 --> 00:02:25.291
"We'll feed the animals."

35
00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:28.528
"Hey!" Bobby frowned.

36
00:02:28.529 --> 00:02:31.522
"Don't boss us around!"

37
00:02:31.523 --> 00:02:33.871
Nina folded her arms.

38
00:02:33.872 --> 00:02:37.526
"Izzie and I want to talk about our sleepover.

39
00:02:37.527 --> 00:02:40.957
So leave us alone."

40
00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:44.993
Cinnamon barked as the kids shouted back and forth.

41
00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:47.709
Chef came to the door.

42
00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:53.348
"Chefs! Get busy—now!"

43
00:02:53.349 --> 00:02:57.940
Later Chef removed the pan from the freezer.

44
00:02:57.941 --> 00:03:01.146
"Great! Our ice cream is frozen.

45
00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:05.997
Now we'll stir something into it."

46
00:03:05.998 --> 00:03:08.922
Nina looked at the options.

47
00:03:08.923 --> 00:03:12.005
There was a bowl of crushed chocolate cookies.

48
00:03:12.006 --> 00:03:16.298
Other bowls had crushed peppermints and other candies.

49
00:03:16.299 --> 00:03:19.953
"I want peppermint," Bobby said.

50
00:03:19.954 --> 00:03:23.528
"Me too!" Jason said.

51
00:03:23.529 --> 00:03:26.989
"I want cookies," Nina said.

52
00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:33.013
Izzie nodded. "Cookies!"

53
00:03:33.014 --> 00:03:37.939
Bobby laughed and pointed to Chef.

54
00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.792
"There are more boys than girls.

55
00:03:40.793 --> 00:03:45.291
That means we get to choose. Right, Chef?"

56
00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:50.538
Chef sighed. "I don't think so, Bobby.

57
00:03:50.539 --> 00:03:56.742
Let's just add both ingredients to the ice cream."

58
00:03:56.743 --> 00:04:00.598
Jason swirled peppermints into the ice cream.

59
00:04:00.599 --> 00:04:04.869
Izzie swirled in cookies.

60
00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:09.552
Chef put the pan back in the freezer.

61
00:04:09.553 --> 00:04:13.016
"The ice cream needs three more hours to freeze. So

62
00:04:13.017 --> 00:04:17.585
we'll taste it tomorrow." ***

63
00:04:17.586 --> 00:04:21.632
The next day Izzie ran into class.

64
00:04:21.633 --> 00:04:26.179
"Nina! Mom said I can sleep over!"

65
00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:31.833
Bobby yawned. "So boring.

66
00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:35.413
They think sleeping is fun."

67
00:04:35.414 --> 00:04:38.755
Jason laughed.

68
00:04:38.756 --> 00:04:42.143
"Bobby's coming home with me today to play video games.

69
00:04:42.144 --> 00:04:45.244
At least we'll be awake!"

70
00:04:45.245 --> 00:04:48.906
Nina frowned but didn't say anything.

71
00:04:48.907 --> 00:04:51.578
Chef got the pan from the freezer.

72
00:04:51.579 --> 00:04:55.839
"Our ice cream is solid. It's ready."

73
00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:01.611
He scooped out five servings.

74
00:05:01.612 --> 00:05:06.415
Nina tasted hers. "Mmm!"

75
00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:11.107
Jason nodded. "It's good. And . . ."

76
00:05:11.108 --> 00:05:14.586
He looked shyly at Nina and Izzie.

77
00:05:14.587 --> 00:05:17.886
"The cookies are my favorite part."

78
00:05:17.887 --> 00:05:23.626
Nina smiled. "Have fun playing video games later."

79
00:05:23.627 --> 00:05:26.459
"Thanks," Jason said.

80
00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:30.805
"Enjoy your sleepover," Bobby said.

81
00:05:30.806 --> 00:05:40.946
Nina licked her spoon and nodded at Izzie. "We will!"

